# Gemma 4 12B for AI Classroom Live's local server (D-14).
#
#   ollama create gemma4-aula -f docs/ollama/Modelfile.aula-gemma
#
# The alternative to qwen3.8-aula, and the better fit on a 16 GB card: 7.8 GB
# against 9.3, 76 tokens/s against 55, and a first sentence in 0.5-0.9 s
# against 1.4 (measured on the RTX 5070 Ti, 15/09/2026). Those 1.5 GB are what
# lets faster-whisper and Kokoro share the card with it.
#
# Needs Ollama 0.34 or newer: 0.33 could not load gemma4's vision component.

FROM gemma4:12b

# Ollama gives gemma4 a 262,144-token context by default, and the cache alone
# then takes 4.5 GB. A class needs a few questions and answers of history.
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
# A ceiling for an answer read aloud: about a minute and a half of speech.
PARAMETER num_predict 350
